ΔS_f(CO2,g) = 20.8 J/mol·K

Now we can calculate the change in entropy (ΔS):

ΔS = (3 * ΔS_f(CO2,g)) - (3 * ΔS_f(CO,g) + 3 * ΔS_f(O3,g))

