   The velocity of the sphere is related to its angular velocity \( \omega \) by \( v = R \omega \). Since the sphere is rolling without slipping, the velocity of the center of mass is related to the angular velocity by \( v = R \omega \).

2. **Linear Motion of the Center of Mass**:  
