   \]
   Since the concentration of ethanol is constant, the equilibrium constant simplifies to:
   \[
   K = \frac{[E^3(aq)][ \text{NH}_3(aq)]}{[\text{CH}_3\text{COOH}(aq)]} = \frac{0.667}{0.333} = 2
   \]

