2. After the collision, the velocities of the two objects are:
   \[
   v_{M1} = e v_0 \quad \text{(after collision)}
   \]
   \[
   v_{M2} = v_0 - e v_0 = (1 - e) v_0 \quad \text{(after collision)}
   \]
